          "instructions": "Professional, concise, and paced for an introductory course audience.",
          "text": "Next, draw the system boundary. Does the study include raw-material extraction, manufacturing, transport, use, reuse, recycling, and disposal? Which environmental effects will be assessed? A result is only meaningful when the boundary and exclusions are visible, because moving a stage outside the analysis can move its impacts out of sight."
