          "instructions": "Professional, concise, and paced for an introductory course audience.",
          "text": "To compare two products fairly, begin with the service they provide. One bottle versus one can may not be equivalent if their sizes or reuse patterns differ. A functional unit—such as delivering one thousand liters of beverage—creates a common basis for counting materials, energy, emissions, and waste."
